{"suttaId":"an10.110","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"A-x","vriCode":"s0404m3.mul","paras":[1016,1018],"vripara":"110"},"segments":{"an10.110:0.3":"Niddhamanīyasuttaṃ","an10.110:1.1":"“Dasayime, bhikkhave, niddhamanīyā dhammā.","an10.110:1.2":"Katame dasa?","an10.110:1.3":"Sammādiṭṭhikassa, bhikkhave, micchādiṭṭhi niddhantā hoti;","an10.110:1.4":"ye ca micchādiṭṭhipaccayā aneke pāpakā akusalā dhammā sambhavanti te cassa niddhantā honti;","an10.110:1.5":"sammādiṭṭhipaccayā ca aneke kusalā dhammā bhāvanāpāripūriṃ gacchanti.","an10.110:2.1":"“Sammāsaṅkappassa, bhikkhave, micchāsaṅkappo niddhanto hoti…pe…","an10.110:2.2":"sammāvācassa bhikkhave, micchāvācā niddhantā hoti…","an10.110:2.3":"sammākammantassa, bhikkhave, micchākammanto niddhanto hoti…","an10.110:2.4":"sammāājīvassa, bhikkhave, micchāājīvo niddhanto hoti…","an10.110:2.5":"sammāvāyāmassa, bhikkhave, micchāvāyāmo niddhanto hoti…","an10.110:2.6":"sammāsatissa, bhikkhave, micchāsati niddhantā hoti…","an10.110:2.7":"sammāsamādhissa, bhikkhave, micchāsamādhi niddhanto hoti…","an10.110:2.8":"sammāñāṇissa, bhikkhave, micchāñāṇaṃ niddhantaṃ hoti….","an10.110:3.1":"“Sammāvimuttissa, bhikkhave, micchāvimutti niddhantā hoti;","an10.110:3.2":"ye ca micchāvimuttipaccayā aneke pāpakā akusalā dhammā sambhavanti te cassa niddhantā honti;","an10.110:3.3":"sammāvimuttipaccayā ca aneke kusalā dhammā bhāvanāpāripūriṃ gacchanti.","an10.110:3.4":"Ime kho, bhikkhave, dasa niddhamanīyā dhammā”ti.","an10.110:3.5":"Dasamaṃ. 11."},"unsure":[],"preface":[],"attha":{"book":"Mp-x","bookName":"Dasakanipāta-aṭṭhakathā","vriCode":"s0404a.att","from":651,"to":652,"paras":[{"para":651,"vripara":"108-110","refs":["an10.110:1"],"lines":["Aṭṭhame <b>virecana</b>nti dosanīharaṇabhesajjaṃ.","<b>Virittā hotī</b>ti nīhaṭā hoti panuditā.","Navame <b>vamana</b>nti vamanakaraṇabhesajjaṃ.","Dasame <b>niddhamanīyā</b>ti niddhamitabbā.","<b>Niddhantā</b>ti niddhamitā. 11."],"lineRefs":[["an10.110:1"],["an10.110:1"],["an10.110:1"],["an10.110:1"],["an10.110:1"]]},{"para":652,"vripara":null,"refs":["an10.110:1"],"lines":["Paṭhamaasekhasuttavaṇṇanā 111."],"lineRefs":[["an10.110:1"]]}],"wordLinks":[]},"tika":{"book":"Mp-t-x","bookName":"Dasakanipāta-ṭīkā","vriCode":"s0404t.tik","from":746,"to":750,"paras":[{"para":746,"vripara":"101-112","refs":["an10.110:1"],"lines":["Tatiyassa paṭhamādīni uttānāni.","Chaṭṭhe <b>nijjarakāraṇānī</b>ti pajahanakāraṇāni.","Imasmiṃ maggo kathīyatīti katvā <b>“ayaṃ heṭṭhā…pe… puna gahitā”</b>ti vuttaṃ.","Kiñcāpi nijjiṇṇā micchādiṭṭhīti ānetvā sambandhitabbaṃ.","Yathā micchādiṭṭhi vipassanāya nijjiṇṇāpi na samucchinnāti samucchedappahānadassanatthaṃ puna gahitā, evaṃ micchāsaṅkappādayopi vipassanāya pahīnāpi asamucchinnatāya idha puna gahitāti ayamattho “micchāsaṅkappassā”tiādīsu sabbapadesu vattabboti dasseti <b>“evaṃ sabbapadesu yojetabbo”</b>ti iminā.","<b>Ettha cā</b>ti “sammāvimuttipaccayā ca aneke kusalā dhammā bhāvanāpāripūriṃ gacchantī”ti etasmiṃ pāḷipade.","Ettha ca samucchedavasena ca paṭippassaddhivasena ca paṭipakkhadhammānaṃ sammadeva vimuccanaṃ <b>sammāvimutti</b>.","Tappaccayā ca maggaphalesu aṭṭha indriyāni bhāvanāpāripūriṃ upagacchantīti maggasampayuttānipi saddhādīni indriyāni uddhaṭāni.","Maggavasena hi phalesu bhāvanāpāripūrī nāmāti.","<b>Abhinandanaṭṭhenā</b>ti ativiya sinehanaṭṭhena.","Idañhi somanassindriyaṃ ukkaṃsagatasātasabhāvato sampayuttadhamme sinehantaṃ tementaṃ viya pavattati.","<b>Pavattasantatiādhipateyyaṭṭhenā</b>ti vipākasantānassa jīvane adhipatibhāvena.","<b>Eva</b>ntiādi vuttasseva atthassa nigamanaṃ.","Sattamādīni uttānatthāni."],"lineRefs":[["an10.110:1"],["an10.110:1"],["an10.110:1"],["an10.110:1"],["an10.110:1"],["an10.110:1"],["an10.110:1"],["an10.110:1"],["an10.110:1"],["an10.110:1"],["an10.110:1"],["an10.110:1"],["an10.110:1"],["an10.110:1"]]},{"para":747,"vripara":null,"refs":["an10.110:1"],"lines":["Samaṇasaññāsuttādivaṇṇanā niṭṭhitā."],"lineRefs":[["an10.110:1"]]},{"para":748,"vripara":null,"refs":["an10.110:1"],"lines":["Samaṇasaññāvaggavaṇṇanā niṭṭhitā. (12) 2."],"lineRefs":[["an10.110:1"]]},{"para":749,"vripara":null,"refs":["an10.110:1"],"lines":["Paccorohaṇivaggo 1-4."],"lineRefs":[["an10.110:1"]]},{"para":750,"vripara":null,"refs":["an10.110:1"],"lines":["Paṭhamaadhammasuttādivaṇṇanā 113-6."],"lineRefs":[["an10.110:1"]]}],"wordLinks":[]},"tika2":null}
